**DRAFT (awaiting Gary).** 450 of 450 written (COMPLETE: 450 of 450). Generated 2026-10-23 00:26 CT. Machine copy: `DEX_450.json`.

Story order: dex numbers run in the order the player meets each zone (CRITICAL_PATH.md). Existing 16 creatures keep their names, types and art (marked ★). Lines are listed together; evolutions sit right after their pre-evolution.

